&lt;p&gt;By setting up this Power Automate flow, I no longer have to worry about manually tracking work item updates or notifying team members. Whether a work item is resolved, blocked, or closed, the flow ensures the right people get notified at the right time. Plus, with the artifact link checks, developers can easily review the associated commits and pull requests.&lt;/p&gt;
